      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I would also say, can see in the API there being a spot for Pronouns History. If alongside this update, they'll be able to add in a dropdown for \"Other\" pronouns to easily change across different pronouns.\n\n(Esp useful for DID/Plural folks or even Roleplayers who also use that as an easy way to see diff characters)\n\nThat would be awesome!\n\nAlso nameplate width for pronouns is... pretty tiny. (But I think that is being addressed in another Canny)",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
