      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{61cea3c99954c41ea7b7a8d2|full_name} Honestly, if pronoun history was utilized and available for the user, it would mean we wouldn't have to type out a custom pronoun set every time we have a switch (DID user - uses the pronouns as an accessibility tool)",
